Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Add PEFT parameter-selection hook (finetune_mode:
 full|bitfit|regex)

select_trainable() in finetuning/peft.py picks what the optimizer trains and
freezes the rest; wired via finetune_mode/finetune_cfg ctor args on
FinetunedTabPFNBase + both subclasses. mode=full returns all params with
requires_grad untouched (exact upstream behavior). Logs trainable/total count.
